" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics  "
"┌My Issues───────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│No op┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────┐      │"
"│     │             new issue             │      │"
"│     │  P/dp/R/dr  parent / relations    │      │"
"│     │                                   │      │"
"│     │ Open & copy                       │      │"
"│     │  Enter  open the issue            │      │"
"│     │  yi/yu  copy key / URL            │      │"
"│     │  yb/ym  copy branch / link        │      │"
"│     │  o      Linear page or PR         │      │"
"│     │  O      other links               │      │"
"│     │  gr     related issue             │      │"
"│     │                                   │      │"
"│     │ App                               │      │"
"│     │  1/2/3  screens   r      refresh  │      │"
